WEBVTT

00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,640
I unexpectedly needed a blood transfusion a few weeks ago,

00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:16,480
and my hemoglobin levels were very, very low.

00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:20,920
So I have low hemoglobin levels, that's part of anemia.

00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:23,280
So 7.7 is very low.

00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:28,320
And I highly recommend that if a person has those kind of levels

00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:32,320
that getting a blood transfusion is the right thing to do.

00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:34,520
I later called the blood bank to learn

00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:38,040
if I could have specific people donate blood for me,

00:00:38,080 --> 00:00:42,080
like family members for future possible transfusions.

00:00:42,080 --> 00:00:46,240
My motivation in part was to have people who did not take

00:00:46,240 --> 00:00:49,480
a COVID vaccine donate to me directly.

00:00:49,480 --> 00:00:52,640
The blood bank takes it very difficult

00:00:52,640 --> 00:00:56,160
to have a donation directed specifically to.

00:00:56,160 --> 00:00:59,680
The woman told me that the vaccine is not in the blood,

00:00:59,680 --> 00:01:03,080
but then said that they do not even test for this.

00:01:03,080 --> 00:01:06,880
My question is, do you think this is true

00:01:06,880 --> 00:01:11,240
that the vaccine material mRNA DNA do not circulate

00:01:11,240 --> 00:01:13,120
in the bloodstream, but therefore are not

00:01:13,120 --> 00:01:15,440
a concern with receiving a blood transfusion

00:01:15,440 --> 00:01:17,800
for an unknown donor?

00:01:17,800 --> 00:01:24,120
Well, my opinion is that it is in there, and it does affect you.

00:01:24,120 --> 00:01:33,040
And we did breach this question a while back.

00:01:33,040 --> 00:01:36,160
After the vaccines came out, people were requesting

00:01:36,240 --> 00:01:38,360
non-vaccinated blood.

00:01:38,360 --> 00:01:42,360
There was some blood banks that did separate that out

00:01:42,360 --> 00:01:44,280
with questionnaires from the patient.

00:01:44,280 --> 00:01:46,160
They were testing the blood.

00:01:46,160 --> 00:01:48,320
They were asking the patient's questions

00:01:48,320 --> 00:01:51,440
where you vaccinated that blood did get separated out.

00:01:51,440 --> 00:01:56,440
I don't know if every blood bank has that availability,

00:01:56,440 --> 00:01:59,560
obviously it doesn't because we just experienced that.

00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:02,800
I don't know that even the blood banks that did have that

00:02:02,800 --> 00:02:07,400
separation of that availability still have that availability.

00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:11,920
Maybe if you were in the 1% elite, you could get anything

00:02:11,920 --> 00:02:13,400
you wanted.

00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:17,440
I just saw that the 1% elite that were traveling to Davos

00:02:17,440 --> 00:02:22,440
to the World Economic Forum's climate change summit

00:02:23,760 --> 00:02:28,040
that's coming up are all requesting demanding

00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:32,560
non-vaccinated pilots to fly their private jets.

00:02:33,320 --> 00:02:37,280
They won't fly with vaccinated pilots.

00:02:37,280 --> 00:02:40,840
So I don't want to offend anybody that's listening to this

00:02:40,840 --> 00:02:43,600
that didn't get the COVID vaccine.

00:02:43,600 --> 00:02:48,560
But if you listen to me long enough, I think that was a great mistake.

00:02:48,560 --> 00:02:52,200
There's very big dangers in that COVID vaccine.

00:02:52,200 --> 00:02:55,120
There's dangers in any vaccine.

00:02:55,120 --> 00:02:57,480
This one is the worst.

00:02:57,480 --> 00:03:02,160
Followed closely by a few others.

00:03:02,160 --> 00:03:05,280
But this is a horrible vaccine.

00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:07,120
It's not even a vaccine.

00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:12,880
It is a DNA danger tool is what it is.

00:03:12,880 --> 00:03:18,080
And it is, I just, it's, you know, you are exposed.

00:03:18,080 --> 00:03:20,240
And even if you never got the vaccine,

00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:25,480
you're still probably if testing was available to know if there's

00:03:25,480 --> 00:03:29,960
mRNA or this DNA fragments from the vaccine in your blood,

00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:31,960
I'd probably test positive for it.

00:03:31,960 --> 00:03:35,800
You would too, even if you didn't get a transfusion

00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:39,320
and didn't get the vaccine, because there's so much cross-tamination

00:03:39,320 --> 00:03:46,480
and because there's so much contamination through, you know,

00:03:46,480 --> 00:03:50,200
anybody that you come in contact with.

00:03:50,200 --> 00:03:54,040
So, you know, I'm not sure that we're not all contaminated.

00:03:54,040 --> 00:03:58,920
But then you have to weigh out the pros and cons of, okay,

00:03:58,920 --> 00:04:01,400
do I not get a blood transfusion?

00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:05,640
Which could save my life and really help me get over

00:04:05,640 --> 00:04:08,880
this giant hump that I'm dealing with so that I can continue

00:04:08,880 --> 00:04:12,400
on with other treatment.

00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:18,320
If I was in your situation, I would probably get the blood.

00:04:18,320 --> 00:04:22,160
There's, you, like I've told you in the past, you know,

00:04:22,160 --> 00:04:28,880
a gun to my head and I would still say no to the COVID vaccine.

00:04:28,880 --> 00:04:35,520
So, it is a concern for those that are trying to be more diligent

00:04:35,520 --> 00:04:39,520
at, you know, and have both physiological reasons

00:04:39,520 --> 00:04:45,680
and moral reasons, not to get exposed to this vaccine.

00:04:45,680 --> 00:04:48,080
But there's some things that are beyond our control

00:04:48,080 --> 00:04:50,280
and there's nothing you can do.

